            ("2×2 matrix inverse", "Linear Algebra", "A⁻¹=(1/(ad−bc))[[d,−b],[−c,a]]", "Inverse of a 2×2 matrix when determinant is nonzero.", "For [[1,2],[3,4]], determinant is −2."),
            ("Trace of matrix", "Linear Algebra", "tr(A)=Σaᵢᵢ", "Sum of the diagonal elements of a square matrix.", "tr([[1,2],[3,4]])=5."),
